    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92869" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥυσ-τήρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆρος</span>,
			ὁ, rare and late form for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥυτήρ</span> (B), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>deliverer</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Tryph.
				266
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>rein</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρύτηρ</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> perh. to be read for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥηστήρ</span>, <i>ladle</i> of an
			irrigating-machine, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				1821.210
			</span></i>.</div>
